WEBVTT

00:38:28.980 --> 00:38:32.186
And I quickly got on the phone
with my brother.

00:38:32.210 --> 00:38:35.416
He was packing his bags to head to Tucson.

00:38:35.440 --> 00:38:37.298
You know, I'm on the space station now,

00:38:37.322 --> 00:38:41.403
and I can't be there physically
to be supportive to my family.

00:38:42.480 --> 00:38:46.646
Couple hours later, the CAPCOM called up
on the privatized channel,

00:38:46.670 --> 00:38:49.536
and they told me Gabby had passed away

00:38:49.560 --> 00:38:51.660
because that's what
the news was reporting.

00:38:53.575 --> 00:38:57.992
Later, I found out she was
still alive, thankfully.

00:38:58.016 --> 00:38:59.386
(Music)

00:38:59.410 --> 00:39:02.126
AG: That experience taught Scott
a powerful lesson.